<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 30. </span>First set of survey histograms for textual elicitation with Gem-2f and follow-up ratings at <math id="A5.F30.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\mathrm{LLM}}=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>LLM</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\mathrm{LLM}}=0.5</annotation></semantics></math>, with image stimulus and prompting the LLM with <em id="A5.F30.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">zero</em> demographic information. For semantic similarity rating (SSR), we used the the result for the best reference set (4).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F31" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.08338v1/Fig31.svg" id="A5.F31.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/238;" width="476" height="238"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 31. </span>Second set of survey histograms for textual elicitation with Gem-2f and follow-up ratings at <math id="A5.F31.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\mathrm{LLM}}=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>LLM</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\mathrm{LLM}}=0.5</annotation></semantics></math>, with image stimulus and prompting the LLM with <em id="A5.F31.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">zero</em> demographic information. For semantic similarity rating (SSR), we used the the result for the best reference set (4).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F32" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2510.08338v1/Fig32.svg" id="A5.F32.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/204;" width="476" height="204"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 32. </span>Scan over post-elicitation temperature <math id="A5.F32.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> values and change in success metrics for textual elicitation at <math id="A5.F32.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\mathrm{LLM}}=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>LLM</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\mathrm{LLM}}=0.5</annotation></semantics></math> with GPT-4o and image stimulus, with full demography setup. For semantic similarity rating (SSR), we used the mean over all reference sets. Horizontal lines refer to the corresponding follow-up Likert rating values for this experiment, which are unaffected by choice of reference set and <math id="A5.F32.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
